# =============================================================================
# imetech-engineering uren-pwa + boekhouding-pwa — public repos: PWA's + Pages deploy ONLY
# =============================================================================
# This workspace lives inside a larger Automatisatie folder. Default-deny
# prevents accidental `git add .` from publishing desktop apps, Excel, secrets,
# or other local tooling.
#
# Allowed in git:
#   .github/workflows/deploy-*-pwa.yml
#   applications/uren/pwa/**
#   applications/boekhouding/pwa/**
# =============================================================================

# --- Default: ignore everything at repo root ---
/*
!/.gitignore

# --- GitHub Actions (Pages deploy workflow only) ---
!/.github/
/.github/*
!/.github/workflows/
/.github/workflows/*
!/.github/workflows/deploy-uren-pwa.yml
!/.github/workflows/deploy-boekhouding-pwa.yml

# --- PWA (sole application artifact) ---
!/applications/
/applications/*
!/applications/uren/
/applications/uren/*
!/applications/uren/pwa/
!/applications/boekhouding/
/applications/boekhouding/*
!/applications/boekhouding/pwa/

# --- Never commit secrets or data files (any path) ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env.local
**/secrets.*
**/credentials*.json
**/*token*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12

# --- Never commit Excel / exports (business data) ---
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xlsm
**/*.xls
**/*.csv

# --- Desktop / Python ecosystem (not needed for PWA) ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/*.spec
**/node_modules/

# --- OS / editor noise ---
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
